            "review_title": "Review at Bếp Nhà 196",
            "review_text": "TommyHK888\nGermany711 contributions\n0\nGood restaurant with reasonable prices\nApr 2023 • Friends\nThe restaurant is somewhat inconspicuously located next to the Ben-Thanh market. When you walk through the narrow entrance to the 2nd floor, you first think you're lost. But it is a very friendly restaurant with equally friendly service. The food is excellent and the prices are reasonable. So don't let the entrance put you off. I will gladly come again.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nShow original\nWritten March 25, 2024",
